{"description": "<div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Work Setup:<strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" id=\"isPasted\">&nbsp;On-site in Cluj, Romania</span></strong></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The <strong>Technical Support Representative II</strong> is responsible for handling customer inquiries and resolving moderately complex issues via up to two communication channels, including phone, email, and chat. This role serves as an experienced customer support resource by providing product and service guidance, managing escalated customer concerns, and delivering high-quality customer experiences while meeting operational performance expectations.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style='box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --sdf-math-direction-rtl: 1; --sdf-display-direction-rtl: none; --sdf-display-direction-ltr: \"\"; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; color: rgb(38, 35, 33); font-family: Circular, -apple-system, \"system-ui\", \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Fira Sans\", \"Droid Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;' id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">What does a day in the life of a <span style=\"font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-pasted=\"true\"><strong>Technical Support Representative II</strong></span> look like?</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\">Respond to customer inquiries through up to two communication channels, including phone, email, or chat</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\">Handle customer cases that remain unresolved after Fin/automation</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\">Handle more complex, long-tail, and unique cases outside the generic playbook</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\">Troubleshoot customer issues including email syncing, automations, billing, payments, subscriptions, renewals/discounts, and account/access issues</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\">Investigate beyond existing documentation/playbooks to find solutions</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\">Use no-code tools such as Zapier/Make</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\">Take cases through to closure rather than simply escalating</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\">Escalate genuine product bugs to Product while avoiding Product as a general escalation path</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\">Contribute to improving playbooks/system coverage based on recurring issues</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\">Explain technical issues clearly to non-technical customers and translate technical concepts into simple language</p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style='box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --sdf-math-direction-rtl: 1; --sdf-display-direction-rtl: none; --sdf-display-direction-ltr: \"\"; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; color: rgb(38, 35, 33); font-family: Circular, -apple-system, \"system-ui\", \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Fira Sans\", \"Droid Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;' id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; font-size: 14px; font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">What are the required qualifications of a <span style=\"font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-pasted=\"true\"><strong>Technical Support Representative II</strong></span>?</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">1 to 2+ years in technical support for a SaaS product, ideally CRM or sales tools</li><li style=\"font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Understands how integrations, APIs and email connections (IMAP, OAuth) work</li><li style=\"font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Comfortable with data: CSV imports, field mapping, bulk changes</li><li style=\"font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Strong communication skills, both verbal and written</li><li style=\"font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Advanced technical troubleshooting knowledge in hardware, software, and/or systems</li><li style=\"font-family: tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Proficiency in using computer applications and software</li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style='box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-inset: ; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --sdf-math-direction-rtl: 1; --sdf-display-direction-rtl: none; --sdf-display-direction-ltr: \"\"; line-height: 1.44; margin-top: 3pt; margin-bottom: 3pt; color: rgb(38, 35, 33); font-family: Circular, -apple-system, \"system-ui\", \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Fira Sans\", \"Droid Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; background-col